188211	281672	-	Female	+91 9552761825	\N	VAISHNAVI TURKA	\N	CK MB  (CREATINE KINASE - MB)	Pathology	06-06-2026 09:30	06-06-2026	06-06-2026	812157	\N	CREATINE PHOSPHOKINASE	bgl-Irfan	Descriptive (No Ranges)	-	06-06-2026	06-06-2026	&nbsp;	1. CPK-MB Mass is a cardiac marker which assists in the diagnosis of Acute Myocardial Infarction (AMI).\n2. Elevated levels of CPK-MB occur 4 to 6 hours after the onset of pain in myocardial infarction, peak at 18 to 24 hours and persist upto 72 hours.\n\n3. The decline in CPK-MB follows a predictable course & if the decline shows a sudden increase, it is suggestive of re-infarction.\n\n4. It may also be elevated in cases of Myocarditis, disorders of Skeletal muscle (trauma, intramuscular injections, vigorous exercise,\n\ndermatomyositis, Muscular dystrophy, rhabomyolysis), Stroke, Carbon monoxide poisoning, Pulmonary embolism, Hypothyroidism, etc.	Labwale	\N
